(1) 1346/   86FAA : 1A19                	move.b	(a1)+,d5		; Dividing timing
(1) 1347/   86FAC :                     	; DANGER! Ugh, this bug.
(1) 1348/   86FAC :                     	; In the stock driver, sounds >= $E0 would cause a crash.
(1) 1349/   86FAC :                     	; The original Clone Driver had a really messy workaround, and so does the SCHG (at the time of writing)
(1) 1350/   86FAC :                     	; The real bug is that the SFX only has a range of $3F, after that, everything goes to hell.
(1) 1351/   86FAC :                     	; Why? Look at the routine:
(1) 1352/   86FAC :                     	; The index is made zero-based, so $A0 would become 0 (stock driver values).
(1) 1353/   86FAC :                     	; By this logic, $DF would become $3F, and $E0: $40.
(1) 1354/   86FAC :                     	; The value is then multiplied by 4 (the lsl), to suit the longword indexes of SoundIndex.
(1) 1355/   86FAC :                     	; The result for $3F is $FC. Now do the same to $40, notice something?
(1) 1356/   86FAC :                     	; The result is $100. We go beyond a single byte, this is the catalyst.
(1) 1357/   86FAC :                     	; The second line below (move.b) tries to overwrite the register that holds the modified value... with a byte.
(1) 1358/   86FAC :                     	; So, we blank the *entire* register.
(1) 1359/   86FAC :                     	; DANGER! there is a missing 'moveq	#0,d7' here, without which SFXes whose
(1) 1360/   86FAC :                     	; index entry is above $3F will cause a crash. This is actually the same way that
(1) 1361/   86FAC :                     	; this bug is fixed in Ristar's driver.
(1) 1362/   86FAC : 7E00                	moveq	#0,d7
(1) 1363/   86FAE :                     
(1) 1364/   86FAE : 1E19                	move.b	(a1)+,d7	; Number of tracks (FM + PSG)
(1) 1365/   86FB0 : 5307                	subq.b	#1,d7
(1) 1366/   86FB2 : 7C2E                	moveq	#SMPS_Track.len,d6
(1) 1367/   86FB4 :                     ; loc_72228:
(1) 1368/   86FB4 :                     .sfx_loadloop:
(1) 1369/   86FB4 : 7600                	moveq	#0,d3
