(1) 2189/   87544 :                     
(1) 2190/   87544 :                     ; List of cycle counts from various revisions of WriteFMI (Write cycles + 'wait for YM' cycles)
(1) 2191/   87544 :                     
(1) 2192/   87544 :                     ; (SMPS 68k Type 1a)
(1) 2193/   87544 :                     ;  Michael Jackson's Moonwalker:
(1) 2194/   87544 :                     ;	32(6/2) + 68(14/0)
(1) 2195/   87544 :                     ;  Strider Hiryuu
(1) 2196/   87544 :                     ;	32(6/2) + 58(12/0) (Slightly optimised by replacing a btst #7's function with a bmi)
(1) 2197/   87544 :                     
(1) 2198/   87544 :                     
(1) 2199/   87544 :                     ; (SMPS 68k Type 1b)
(1) 2200/   87544 :                     ;  Sonic the Hedgehog:
(1) 2201/   87544 :                     ;	32(6/2) + 80(17/0) (Interestingly, this uses the Type 1a version, with some nops, so is this an *early* Type 1b driver?)
(1) 2202/   87544 :                     ;  Mega PCM standard:
(1) 2203/   87544 :                     ;	52(10/3) + 102(21/0)
(1) 2204/   87544 :                     ;  Golden Axe 2:
(1) 2205/   87544 :                     ;	32(6/2) + 44(9/0)
(1) 2206/   87544 :                     ;  Nekketsu Koukou Dodgeball Bu Soccer Hen MD:
