(1) 3428/   87CE8 :                     ; for continuous SFX; if the result is zero, the continuous SFX will be flagged
(1) 3429/   87CE8 :                     ; to stop.
(1) 3430/   87CE8 :                     ; Non-continuous SFX do not loop.
