(1) 3452/   87D0A :                     ; Sends an FM command to the YM2612. The command is sent to part I, so not all
(1) 3453/   87D0A :                     ; registers can be set using this coord. flag (in particular, channels FM4,
(1) 3454/   87D0A :                     ; FM5 and FM6 cannot (in general) be affected).
(1) 3455/   87D0A :                     ;
(1) 3456/   87D0A :                     ; Has 2 parameter bytes: a 1-byte register selector and a 1-byte register data.
